      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Middleburg was chosen as the polling place for local elections, making it a civic hub in the 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
